  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of odd numbered terms and the sum of even numbered terms in the expansion of $(x+a)^{n}$ are $A$ and $B$ respectively, then the value of $\\left(x^{2}-\\right.$ $\\left.a^{2}\\right)^{n}$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{A}^{2}-\\mathrm{B}^{2}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{A}^{2}+\\mathrm{B}^{2}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$4 \\mathrm{AB}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{r}\r\n\r\n(x+a)^{n}={ }^{n} C_{0} x^{n}+{ }^{n} C_{1} x^{n-1} a+{ }^{n} C_{2} x^{n-2} a^{2} \\\\\r\n\r\n+{ }^{n} C_{3} x^{n-3} a^{3}+{ }^{n} C_{4} x^{n-4} a^{4}+\\ldots . \\\\\r\n\r\n=\\left({ }^{n} C_{0} x^{n}+{ }^{n} C_{2} x^{n-2} a^{2}+{ }^{n} C_{4} x^{n-4} a^{4}+\\ldots .\\right)+ \\\\\r\n\r\n+\\left({ }^{n} C_{1} x^{n-1} a+{ }^{n} C_{3} x^{n-3} a^{3}+{ }^{n} C_{5} x^{n-5} a^{5}\\right)+\\ldots .\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n$=A+B$ ....(i)\r\n\r\nSimilarly, $(x-a)^{n}=A-B$ ....(ii)\r\n\r\nMultiplying eqns. (1) and (2), we get\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\left(\\mathrm{x}^{2}-\\mathrm{a}^{2}\\right)^{\\mathrm{n}}=\\mathrm{A}^{2}-\\mathrm{B}^{2}\r\n\r\n$$"
  }
}